# HP40gs Stock Font Gallery through the original APLET UI and serial disk.
# HP40gs boots through the CAS front end, then uses the same Kermit completion
# gate as HP39gs instead of a fixed transfer-duration guess.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
13000 tap home
15000 tap aplet
16000 capture aplet-library
17000 tap f5
18000 capture receive-menu
18500 tap down
19200 tap down
19900 tap down
20200 capture receive-serial-disk
20600 tap enter
40000 capture remote-aplet
41500 tap enter
43000 capture lazy-fetch
44000 host-gate

# Times below are relative to host-gate release. Delivery completion and Stock
# UI/install settling are separate events, so use sparse launch-only ENTER
# retries. Once Gallery publishes its 0x47... state, pending retries are
# discarded and the ordinary Gallery navigation keys below remain active.
0 monitor 115000
500 capture fetch-complete
1000 retry enter
11000 retry enter
21000 retry enter
31000 retry enter
46000 retry enter
61000 retry enter

70000 capture native-mini
73000 tap enter
76000 capture native-mini-other
79000 tap down
82000 capture native-main
85000 tap enter
88000 capture native-main-other
91000 tap down
94000 capture native-editline
97000 tap enter
100000 capture native-editline-other
103000 tap right
106000 capture generated-control
109000 tap on
